# ClassicalMechanics

Classical mechanics of particles and rigid bodies in Lean 4: the general theorems of dynamics for
systems of particles (momentum, centre of mass, angular momentum, energy), central forces and the
Kepler problem, the two-body problem and the virial theorem, rigid bodies and rotating frames,
oscillators, Lagrangian and Hamiltonian mechanics.
